```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend (Wizard)
    participant EC as ExamController
    participant TC as TemplateController
    participant TsC as TesterController
    participant PP as PdfParser
    participant DOC as Docling Serve
    participant DB as SessionDatabase
    participant CIS as ConfigInferenceService
    participant GC as GenerationController
    participant TGS as TestGenerationService
    participant LLM as LangChainService (AI)
    participant TFW as TesterFileWriter

    Note over FE: Step 1 — Upload
    FE->>EC: POST /api/exams/upload (PDF)
    EC-->>FE: {examId}
    FE->>TC: POST /api/templates/upload (directory)
    TC-->>FE: {templateId}
    FE->>TsC: POST /api/testers/upload (.java files)
    TsC-->>FE: {testerId}

    FE->>EC: POST /api/exams/{examId}/parse
    EC->>PP: parseToMarkdown(pdf)
    PP->>DOC: HTTP POST (base64 PDF)
    DOC-->>PP: Markdown + base64 images
    PP-->>EC: markdown
    EC->>DB: cache parsed markdown

    Note over FE: Step 2 — Analyze & Review
    FE->>EC: POST /api/exams/{examId}/analyze {templateId, testerId}
    EC->>CIS: inferConfig(markdown, templateDir, testerDir)
    CIS-->>EC: InferredConfig (questions, folders, testers, scores)
    EC-->>FE: InferredConfig (user reviews & edits)

    Note over FE: Step 3 — Recommend & Generate
    loop For each question
        FE->>GC: POST /api/generation/recommendations {examId, questionId, testerId}
        GC->>TGS: recommend(questionContext, existingTesters)
        TGS->>LLM: recommendJson(prompt)
        LLM-->>TGS: {conceptsToCover, rationale}
        TGS-->>GC: TestCaseRecommendation
        GC-->>FE: recommendations (user reviews concepts)

        FE->>GC: POST /api/generation/tests {question, concepts, suggestions}
        GC->>TGS: generateForQuestion(...)

        loop Retry up to 3x
            TGS->>LLM: generateTestCasesJson(prompt)
            LLM-->>TGS: JSON array of test cases
        end

        TGS->>TFW: assemble Java tester code
        TGS-->>GC: GenerationResult {cases, generatedCode}
        GC-->>FE: generated test cases
    end

    Note over FE: Step 4 — Export
    FE->>TsC: POST /api/testers/save {results, outputDir}
    TsC->>TFW: write tester files to disk
    TsC-->>FE: {savedPaths, fileContents}
```
